('hero_eyebrow','Audit · GRC · Cybersecurity','homepage','Hero eyebrow','text',18),
('hero_title','Build Trust. Strengthen Security. Stay Audit-Ready.','homepage','Hero headline','text',19),
('hero_subtitle','We help organizations identify security gaps, strengthen governance, manage technology risks, and achieve compliance through professional audit and cybersecurity consulting services.','homepage','Hero supporting text','textarea',20),
('about_title','An independent partner for security, governance and assurance','homepage','About section title','text',21),
('about_text','We are a team of security and audit practitioners who believe compliance should make organisations genuinely safer — not just produce paperwork. We combine technical testing, control audits and governance advisory under one roof, so findings from a penetration test inform your risk register, and your policies reflect how your systems really work.','homepage','About section text','textarea',22),
('cta_title','Ready to Strengthen Your Organization\'s Security and Compliance?','homepage','Final CTA headline','text',23),
('cta_text','Talk to a consultant about your objectives, timelines and the frameworks that matter to your customers. No obligation, and your information stays confidential.','homepage','Final CTA text','textarea',24),
