(18,2,'infrastructure-vapt','Infrastructure VAPT','cyber','Authorised security testing','server','Comprehensive testing of servers, endpoints, virtualisation and supporting infrastructure.','Infrastructure VAPT looks beyond the network edge at the servers, hypervisors, databases and endpoints that run your business.','This engagement combines vulnerability assessment and penetration testing across operating systems, middleware, databases, virtualisation platforms and endpoints, including privilege-escalation testing where authorised.','Legacy systems and inconsistent hardening create opportunities for attackers who have gained an initial foothold.',NULL,'Authorisation & scoping :: Signed authorisation, asset list, testing windows, contacts and rules of engagement.\nReconnaissance :: Mapping the authorised attack surface, technologies and entry points.\nAutomated discovery :: Industry-standard scanners to establish baseline coverage.\nManual testing :: Expert-led exploration of business logic, chained weaknesses and false-positive elimination.\nControlled exploitation :: Safe proof-of-concept within agreed limits to demonstrate real impact.\nReporting & retest :: Risk-rated findings, remediation guidance and verification retest.','Authorised server and endpoint list\nAuthenticated scanning where credentials are provided\nPrivilege-escalation testing on agreed hosts\nChange-freeze coordination','Operating system hardening\nDatabase & middleware security\nVirtualisation platforms\nEndpoint protection effectiveness\nPrivilege escalation paths\nBackup & management interfaces','Signed scope & rules of engagement\nExecutive and technical VAPT report\nEvidence and proof-of-concept details for each finding\nRemediation tracker (spreadsheet)\nRetest report / closure letter','Executive summary :: Business-level risk overview for leadership.\nTechnical findings :: Each issue with severity (CVSS), affected assets, evidence and reproduction steps.\nRisk heat-map :: Visual distrib