(13,'Will testing disrupt our production systems?','Testing is planned to minimise risk: we agree windows, exclusions and rate limits in advance, avoid destructive techniques unless explicitly approved, and keep an emergency contact line open throughout.',1),
(13,'Do you need written permission?','Yes, always. We only test assets you own or are authorised to test, and only after a signed authorisation and scope document. Cloud and hosting provider policies are respected as part of scoping.',2),
(13,'Is a retest included?','A verification retest within an agreed period is normally included so you can demonstrate that findings have been closed.',3),
