INSERT INTO `faqs` (`question`,`answer`,`topic`,`sort_order`) VALUES
('What is the difference between a readiness assessment, an internal audit and a certification audit?','A readiness assessment identifies gaps against a standard and recommends fixes. An internal audit independently tests whether your management system and controls work. A certification audit is performed by an accredited certification body, which alone can issue the certificate. We provide the first two and help you prepare for the third.','Compliance',1),
('Does Yojo Solutions issue ISO certificates or SOC 2 reports?','No. ISO certificates are issued by accredited certification bodies and SOC 2 reports by licensed CPA firms. We remain independent of those bodies so that our advisory work does not compromise your certification.','Compliance',2),
('How do you make sure security testing is safe and authorised?','Every engagement starts with written authorisation from the asset owner, a defined scope, testing windows, exclusions and emergency contacts. We test only assets you own or are permitted to test.','Security testing',3),
('What is the difference between a vulnerability assessment and a penetration test?','A vulnerability assessment identifies and prioritises known weaknesses broadly. A penetration test goes deeper, safely exploiting weaknesses to demonstrate what an attacker could actually achieve.','Security testing',4),
('How long does a typical engagement take?','A focused VAPT can take one to three weeks including reporting. Readiness programmes for ISO 27001 or SOC 2 commonly run for a few months depending on maturity. We confirm timelines after scoping.','Engagements',5),
('How is pricing determined?','Pricing depends on scope, complexity, number of assets or locations and timelines. After a short scoping call we provide a fixed-fee proposal wherever possible.','Engagements',6),
('Do you work with organisations outside India?','Yes. We support clients remotely and can align to international frameworks such as GDPR, HIPAA and SOC 2, as well as Indian regulations such as the DPDPA and RBI directions.','General',7),
('How do you protect our confidential information?','We sign NDAs, use encrypted channels for evidence exchange, restrict access to engagement teams and securely dispose of data at the end of the engagement. Please do not upload confidential evidence through public website forms.','General',8),
('Is the online Audit Readiness Assessment an official audit?','No. It is a preliminary self-assessment based on your own answers and transparent scoring rules. It is not an audit, certification or assurance opinion, but it is a useful starting point for a conversation.','General',9),
('Do you provide retesting after remediation?','Yes. VAPT engagements normally include a verification retest within an agreed window so you can evidence closure of findings.','Security testing',10);
